  aciklama:
  - "G\xF6r\xFC\u015Ft\xFC\u011F\xFCn ki\u015Finin \xFCzerinde \xE7ok nazar var yaa
    {{isim}}... \U0001F9FF\U0001F612 Fincan\u0131n\u0131n alt k\u0131s\u0131mlar\u0131na
    hapsolmu\u015F \u015Fekilde onu g\xF6r\xFCyorum; \xE7evresinde ise b\xF6l\xFCk
    p\xF6r\xE7\xFCk hale gelmi\u015F telveler var. \u0130nsanlar\u0131n g\xF6zleri,
    onun enerjisini adeta so\u011Furuyor ve oda\u011F\u0131n\u0131 par\xE7al\u0131yor.
    Bu durum da do\u011Fru kararlar almas\u0131n\u0131 ve sana kar\u015F\u0131 tutarl\u0131
    davranmas\u0131n\u0131 zorla\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131yor.\n\nSen {{dogum yili}} do\u011Fumlu
    bir {{burc}} burcuydun \xF6yle de\u011Fil mi? Bu negatif etkile\u015Fimi k\u0131rmak,
    nazar\u0131 da\u011F\u0131tmak ve onu kendine \xE7ekerek i\u015Fleri yoluna koyabilmek
    i\xE7in bir ta\u015F ta\u015F\u0131mal\u0131s\u0131n; mesela {{kelime, akik |
    ye\u015Fim ta\u015F\u0131 | turkuaz | aleksandrit | ametist | apatit | akuamarin
    | aragonit | y\u0131ld\u0131z ta\u015F\u0131 | amazon ta\u015F\u0131 | kan ta\u015F\u0131
    | amber | azurit | krizokol | sitrin | mercan | florit | garnet | hematit | labradorit
    | lacivert ta\u015F\u0131 | krisopraz | bak\u0131r ta\u015F\u0131 | ay ta\u015F\u0131
    | morganit | oniks | rodokrozit | peridot | kuartz | obsidyan | topaz | yakut
    | z\xFCmr\xFCt | jasper | inci | zebercet | kehribar | safir | elmas}}. Kesinlikle
    faydas\u0131n\u0131 g\xF6receksin!\n\nAlt k\u0131s\u0131mlara do\u011Fru beliren
    ve meyve vermemi\u015F incir a\u011Fac\u0131n\u0131 sen de g\xF6r\xFCyor musun
    {{isim}}? Ge\xE7ici bir hastal\u0131\u011Fa i\u015Faret. Sevdi\u011Fin ki\u015Fi,
    {{sayi,2,8}} hafta i\xE7erisinde {{kelime, yak\u0131n bir arkada\u015F\u0131n\u0131n
    | yak\u0131n bir akrabas\u0131n\u0131n | \xE7ok sevdi\u011Fi bir tan\u0131d\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131n}}
    rahats\u0131zland\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 duyup, \xFCz\xFClebilir. Ne ilgin\xE7tir
    ki, bu durum sizi birbirinize daha da yak\u0131nla\u015Ft\u0131racak."
